				<r3d:description language="eng">The dataverse repository was set up to manage data products of the collaborative research of the Ministerio de las Culturas, las Artes y los saberes (https://www.mincultura.gov.co/). The first research project in the repository is about strengthening artistic and cultural education by supporting teachers through classroom observation, collaborative reflection, and targeted professional development, aiming to expand their pedagogical tools, improve instructional quality, and foster innovations that respond to the real needs of their educational communities.</r3d:description>
